\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 I have a curmudgeonly question. Developing an awareness of the magic that\u8217 s happening all around us at any given moment, and understanding that there\u8217 s this vast cosmic dance playing out \u8212  in the abstract, I can see how internalizing those perspectives might change one\u8217 s perspective. But did your understanding of the bigger existential stuff you were writing about actually help you when you were struggling?}
{\rtlch\af2\afs24\ltrch\fs20\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\par}\pard\plain\itap0\s0\fi0\sb200\sa0\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\qj\faauto\sl260\slmult0\rtlch\af2\afs24\ltrch\fs20\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24
